" xml:lang="en-US">English - United Kingdom</text></labels></category><category id="_a2d66a2b-d599-4e3c-b9cc-16decfe5ba8c" name="_A124"><properties><property name="value" value="123" type="3" context="Question"/></properties><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Tajik</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Tajik</text></labels></category><category id="_2839ff62-bcab-44fa-95b4-ecfc1bbd9afd" name="_A125"><properties><property name="value" value="124" type="3" context="Question"/></properties><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Spanish - Peru</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Spanish - Peru</text></labels></category></categories></variable><variable id="4fc3e3ea-2f15-49ed-8176-1c752ae56f52" name="SHELL_LANGUAGECODE" type="2" min="0" mintype="3" max="200" maxtype="3"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Language Code</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Language Code</text></labels></variable><variable id="ca2c5af9-8b19-4724-9dc1-91f677128f87" name="SHELL_INTRO_GDPR" type="3" min="1" mintype="3" max="1" maxtype="3"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Good morning/afternoon/evening, I am__________ from Ipsos, global leader in market research. We are currently conducting a research study and your responses could help to shape and improve products and services. There are no right or wrong answers, and please be assured that the information collected from you will be treated confidentially. Answers from all participants will be combined and only anonymized results will be used for research reporting. Are you happy to proceed with the interview?</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Good morning/afternoon/evening, I am__________ from Ipsos, global leader in market research. We are currently conducting a research study and your responses could help to shape and improve products and services. There are no right or wrong answers, and please be assured that the information collected from you will be treated confidentially. Answers from all participants will be combined and only anonymized results will be used for research reporting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Are you happy to proceed with the interview?</text></labels><categories global-name-space="-1"><deleted/><category id="_dd9f7cbe-cecc-483a-99e4-997d04f6ae9d" name="_A1"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Yes</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Yes</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="1" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category><category id="_9b58f03d-4d4f-419d-9786-1863276cf800" name="_A2"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">No</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">No</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="2" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category></categories></variable><variable id="cdee9b1a-c25d-476e-9495-aad653320d85" name="SHELL_RECORDING_CONFIRMATION" type="3" min="1" mintype="3" max="1" maxtype="3"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">For quality purposes some of the questions during the interview will be automatically audio recorded. Do you agree with the audio recording?</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">For quality purposes some of the questions during the interview will be automatically audio recorded. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you agree with the audio recording?</text></labels><categories global-name-space="-1"><deleted/><category id="_16c71cd1-6277-44d3-8fe3-b72fa794b9d6" name="_A1"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Yes</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Yes</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="1" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category><category id="_6bcdbc65-293e-4c02-bd81-d71725857169" name="_A2"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">No</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">No</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="2" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category></categories></variable><variable id="b6557f48-8558-43da-a24b-6e8b6d2d63f9" name="SHELL_PRIVACY_NOTICE" type="3" min="1" mintype="3" max="1" maxtype="3"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">INTERVIEWER INSTRUCTION: Give the privacy notice information to the respondent and read the following sentence.I’m bringing to your attention the information from this privacy notice which explains about the legal basis and the purposes for processing your personal data as well as your rights under data protection regulations...</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">&lt;span style="color:#dddddd"&gt;INTERVIEWER INSTRUCTION: Give the privacy notice information to the respondent and read the following sentence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I’m bringing to your attention the information from this privacy notice which explains about the legal basis and the purposes for processing your personal data as well as your rights under data protection regulations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;{#SPNtext#}</text></labels><categories global-name-space="-1"><deleted/><category id="_2907fc4c-f44f-4288-b80d-82d1c68dd472" name="_A1"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">Yes</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Yes</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="1" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category><category id="_80e86677-1ccc-4d5e-9680-64af496ef75b" name="_A2"><labels context="LABEL"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="es-PE">No</text><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">No</text></labels><properties><property name="value" value="2" type="3" context="Question"/></properties></category></categories></variable><variable id="7710e133-8a0b-4cac-93a1-d5f28c56e398" name="SHELL_SIGNATURE" type="2" min="0" mintype="3" max="4000" maxtype="